From 01941e21aaaa71377eec7ed6f42533e292039dc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpv_tc <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:13:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vo: add DeckLink mirror output

Mirrors the frames shown by the VO, without OSD, to a Blackmagic DeckLink
device: --decklink-mirror, --decklink-mode, --decklink-delay. The card runs
scheduled playback on its own clock; each slot is filled with the frame
that was due a fixed latency earlier, so the output stays smooth regardless
of the window's vsync. Windows backend via the Desktop Video COM API (SDK
12.0 IDL compiled with widl); a dummy backend allows testing without
hardware.
